#: desc: The parser state after each line of Makefile.formats-escape
#: trace
test/fixtures/Makefile.formats-escape
#: stdout
== test/fixtures/Makefile.formats-escape
   1 . -   0  1 | ##@ Section with <tags> & ampersands
   2 . -   0  1 |
   3 . -   1  1 | ## Run the tests (use AWK=<variant> & co)
   4 . R   0  0 | test:
   4 ========== => target:test +section
   5 . R   0  0 |
   6 . R   1  0 | ## Grouped targets (displayed with a &)
   7 . R   0  0 | a b&:
   7 ========== => target:a b&
   8 . R   0  0 |
   9 . R   1  0 | ## A variable with a \ backslash and {braces}
  10 . -   0  0 | VAR := 1
  10 ========== => variable:VAR
